  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Tech</strong></p><p><strong>Discharged:</strong> When you successfully attack a target within Close range using a weapon, arc currents enhance your strike. Add <strong>1d8</strong> to your damage roll. Then place this card in your vault.</p><p><strong>Charged:</strong> When you successfully attack a target within Close range using a weapon, <strong>spend a Charge</strong> to unleash an electric arc onto another target within Very Close range of the first one. The second target must make a Reaction Roll <strong>with a Difficulty of your attack roll</strong>. They take <strong>1d10</strong> energy damage on a failure and half damage on a success.</p><p><strong>Overcharged:</strong> When you successfully attack a target within Close range using a weapon, <strong>spend 2 Charges</strong> to unleash electric arcs on all targets within Very Close range of the first one. All secondary targets must make a Reaction Roll <strong>with a Difficulty of your attack roll</strong>. They take <strong>1d12</strong> energy damage on a failure and half damage on a success. Then place this card in your vault.</p>",
